{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        InputReader in = new InputReader(System.in);\n        PrintWriter out = new PrintWriter(System.out);\n        CGregAndFriends solver = new CGregAndFriends();\n        solver.solve(1, in, out);\n        out.close();\n    }\n\n    static class CGregAndFriends {\n        static final long MOD = 1000000007L;\n        static final long INF = (long)1e18 + 1;\n        long[][] C = new long[100][100];\n\n        long ways(long base, int a, int b, int c, int d) {\n            base = (base * C[a][b]) % MOD;\n            base = (base * C[c][d]) % MOD;\n            return base;\n        }\n\n        void solve(int testNum, InputReader in, PrintWriter out) {\n            int n = in.nextInt();\n            int K = in.nextInt();\n            int cnt50 = 0, cnt100 = 0;\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                if (in.nextInt() == 50) cnt50++;\n                else cnt100++;\n            }\n\n            for (int i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\n                for (int j = 0; j <= i; j++) {\n                    C[i][j] = (j == 0 || j == i) ? 1 : (C[i-1][j] + C[i-1][j-1]) % MOD;\n                }\n            }\n\n            long[][][] dist = new long[200][200][2];\n            long[][][] num = new long[200][200][2];\n            for (int i = 0; i < 200; i++) {\n                for (int j = 0; j < 200; j++) {\n                    Arrays.fill(dist[i][j], INF);\n                }\n            }\n\n            dist[0][0][0] = 0;\n            num[0][0][0] = 1;\n\n            Deque<State> dq = new ArrayDeque<>();\n            dq.add(new State(0, 0, 0, 0));\n\n            while (!dq.isEmpty()) {\n                State s = dq.removeFirst();\n                int x = s.x;\n                int y = s.y;\n                int side = s.side;\n                long d = dist[x][y][side];\n\n                if (side == 0) {\n                    int r50 = cnt50 - x;\n                    int r100 = cnt100 - y;\n                    for (int t50 = 0; t50 <= r50; t50++) {\n                        for (int t100 = 0; t100 <= r100; t100++) {\n                            if (t50 + t100 == 0) continue;\n                            if (t50 * 50 + t100 * 100 > K) break;\n\n                            int nx = x + t50;\n                            int ny = y + t100;\n                            int ns = side ^ 1;\n                            long nd = d + 1;\n\n                            if (dist[nx][ny][ns] >= nd) {\n                                if (dist[nx][ny][ns] > nd) {\n                                    dist[nx][ny][ns] = nd;\n                                    dq.addLast(new State(nx, ny, ns, nd));\n                                }\n                                num[nx][ny][ns] = (num[nx][ny][ns] + ways(num[x][y][side], r50, t50, r100, t100)) % MOD;\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    int r50 = x;\n                    int r100 = y;\n                    for (int t50 = 0; t50 <= r50; t50++) {\n                        for (int t100 = 0; t100 <= r100; t100++) {\n                            if (t50 + t100 == 0) continue;\n                            if (t50 * 50 + t100 * 100 > K) break;\n\n                            int nx = x - t50;\n                            int ny = y - t100;\n                            int ns = side ^ 1;\n                            long nd = d + 1;\n\n                            if (dist[nx][ny][ns] >= nd) {\n                                if (dist[nx][ny][ns] > nd) {\n                                    dist[nx][ny][ns] = nd;\n                                    dq.addLast(new State(nx, ny, ns, nd));\n                                }\n                                num[nx][ny][ns] = (num[nx][ny][ns] + ways(num[x][y][side], r50, t50, r100, t100)) % MOD;\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            if (dist[cnt50][cnt100][1] == INF) {\n                out.println(-1);\n            } else {\n                out.println(dist[cnt50][cnt100][1]);\n            }\n            out.println(num[cnt50][cnt100][1]);\n        }\n\n        static class State {\n            int x, y, side;\n            long d;\n            State(int x, int y, int side, long d) {\n                this.x = x;\n                this.y = y;\n                this.side = side;\n                this.d = d;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class InputReader {\n        private final InputStream in;\n        private final byte[] buf = new byte[1024];\n        private int ptr = 0, len = 0;\n\n        InputReader(InputStream in) { this.in = in; }\n\n        private int read() {\n            if (len == -1) throw new RuntimeException();\n            if (ptr >= len) {\n                ptr = 0;\n                try { len = in.read(buf); } catch (IOException e) { throw new RuntimeException(); }\n                if (len <= 0) return -1;\n            }\n            return buf[ptr++];\n        }\n\n        public int nextInt() {\n            int c = read();\n            while (c <= 32) c = read();\n            int val = 0, sign = 1;\n            if (c == '-') { sign = -1; c = read(); }\n            for (; '0' <= c && c <= '9'; c = read()) val = val * 10 + c - '0';\n            return val * sign;\n        }\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\nMOD = 1000000007\nINF = 10**18 + 1\n\n# Precompute combinations\nC = [[0] * 100 for _ in range(100)]\nfor i in range(100):\n    for j in range(i + 1):\n        if j == 0 or j == i:\n            C[i][j] = 1\n        else:\n            C[i][j] = (C[i-1][j] + C[i-1][j-1]) % MOD\n\ndef ways(base, a, b, c, d):\n    base = (base * C[a][b]) % MOD\n    base = (base * C[c][d]) % MOD\n    return base\n\ndef solve():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    n = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    K = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    \n    cnt50 = 0\n    cnt100 = 0\n    for _ in range(n):\n        val = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n        if val == 50:\n            cnt50 += 1\n        else:\n            cnt100 += 1\n    \n    dist = [[[INF] * 2 for _ in range(200)] for __ in range(200)]\n    num = [[[0] * 2 for _ in range(200)] for __ in range(200)]\n    \n    dist[0][0][0] = 0\n    num[0][0][0] = 1\n    \n    dq = deque()\n    dq.append((0, 0, 0, 0))  # x, y, side, d\n    \n    while dq:\n        x, y, side, d = dq.popleft()\n        \n        if side == 0:\n            r50 = cnt50 - x\n            r100 = cnt100 - y\n            for t50 in range(r50 + 1):\n                for t100 in range(r100 + 1):\n                    if t50 + t100 == 0:\n                        continue\n                    if t50 * 50 + t100 * 100 > K:\n                        break\n                    \n                    nx = x + t50\n                    ny = y + t100\n                    ns = side ^ 1\n                    nd = d + 1\n                    \n                    if dist[nx][ny][ns] >= nd:\n                        if dist[nx][ny][ns] > nd:\n                            dist[nx][ny][ns] = nd\n                            dq.append((nx, ny, ns, nd))\n                        num[nx][ny][ns] = (num[nx][ny][ns] + ways(num[x][y][side], r50, t50, r100, t100)) % MOD\n        else:\n            r50 = x\n            r100 = y\n            for t50 in range(r50 + 1):\n                for t100 in range(r100 + 1):\n                    if t50 + t100 == 0:\n                        continue\n                    if t50 * 50 + t100 * 100 > K:\n                        break\n                    \n                    nx = x - t50\n                    ny = y - t100\n                    ns = side ^ 1\n                    nd = d + 1\n                    \n                    if dist[nx][ny][ns] >= nd:\n                        if dist[nx][ny][ns] > nd:\n                            dist[nx][ny][ns] = nd\n                            dq.append((nx, ny, ns, nd))\n                        num[nx][ny][ns] = (num[nx][ny][ns] + ways(num[x][y][side], r50, t50, r100, t100)) % MOD\n    \n    if dist[cnt50][cnt100][1] == INF:\n        print(-1)\n    else:\n        print(dist[cnt50][cnt100][1])\n    print(num[cnt50][cnt100][1])\n\nsolve()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-4.970903682988137e-05, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.062122225761413574, -0.012910470366477966, -3.6954811548639555e-06, -0.0002317160106031224, -0.0001227780303452164, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -8.463501580990851e-05, -0.0002754547167569399, -0.236641988158226, -3.576278118089249e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -2.777537883957848e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -0.4287057816982269